  {
   "n": 7,
   "id": "b41a93d",
   "doc": "wp-post#168788",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9375c58c-2c.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2c.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "titleAttr": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 43,
     "h": 38,
     "inHeading": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Seeds vs Clones: What Is the Difference?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Both <a href=\"/categories/seeds/\">seeds</a> and <a href=\"/categories/clones/\" data-link=\"dead\">clones</a> have advantages depending on cultivation goals.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/95f6b262-seeds-vs-clones-chart.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"784\" height=\"272\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/seeds-vs-clones-chart.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p><p>Neither option is “better” overall. Professional cultivators often use both depending on the strain and desired outcome.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9375c58c-2c.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2c.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "titleAttr": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 43,
     "h": 38,
     "inHeading": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "How Seeds and Clones Affect the Cannabis Industry"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Seeds and clones are the foundation of modern cannabis cultivation. Every strain found in a dispensary today originated through selective breeding, cloning, or both.</p><p>The cannabis industry relies heavily on:</p><ul><li>Stable genetics</li><li>Consistent cultivation</li><li>Reliable cannabinoid profiles</li><li>Predictable terpene production</li></ul><p>As regulations evolve, cannabis genetics are becoming increasingly important. Growers carefully protect and manage high quality genetics to maintain consistency and product quality across harvests.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9375c58c-2c.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2c.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "titleAttr": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 43,
     "h": 38,
     "inHeading": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cannabis Genetics and Quality Matter"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>At <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong>, we prioritize products sourced from cultivators who focus on quality genetics, responsible growing practices, and consistent testing standards.</p><p>The genetics behind a strain influence:</p><ul><li>Flavor</li><li>Potency</li><li>Aroma</li><li>Effects</li><li>Overall experience</li></ul><p>Understanding where cannabis begins helps consumers appreciate the craftsmanship involved in cultivation.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9375c58c-2c.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2c.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "titleAttr": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 43,
     "h": 38,
     "inHeading": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "The Future of Cannabis Cultivation"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>As cannabis legalization continues to evolve, genetics and breeding will play an even bigger role in the future of the industry.</p><p>Cultivators are constantly developing:</p><ul><li>New terpene profiles</li><li>More balanced cannabinoid ratios</li><li>Disease resistant plants</li><li>Unique flavor experiences</li></ul><p>Both seeds and clones will continue shaping the future of cannabis innovation.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "id": "455661f",
   "doc": "wp-post#168788",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9375c58c-2c.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2c.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "titleAttr": "Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 43,
     "h": 38,
     "inHeading": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Learn More at Cape Cod Cannabis"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Whether you are exploring <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, or <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, understanding cannabis cultivation helps create a deeper appreciation for the plant itself.</p><p>If you are searching for a <strong>dispensary near me</strong> or a <a href=\"/\"><strong>trusted dispensary in Wellfleet</strong></a>, visit Cape Cod Cannabis and speak with our knowledgeable team. We are always happy to answer questions and help you learn more about the world of cannabis.</p><p><strong><em>Cannabis starts with great genetics and thoughtful cultivation, and every great experience begins at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet.</em></strong></p><p><img src=\"assets/source/8b17d636-CCC_Logo_320px-2-300x248.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA...It's worth the trip!\" width=\"300\" height=\"248\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/CCC_Logo_320px-2-300x248.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/1c48453a-CCC_Logo_320px-2.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Always worth the trip!"
    }
   ]
